      "text": "This is a research assignment. Dr. Carlo from the Pioneer Lab has requested an escort."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Dr. Carlo",
      "text": "I'm conducting a wildlife survey across three biomes — valley, wetlands, and snowfield."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Dr. Carlo",
      "text": "Research Team 4 was doing similar work before their funding was cut. I want to pick up where they left off."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Principal",
      "text": "The field is dangerous. Dr. Carlo will need protection while he works."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Dr. Carlo",
      "text": "I won't slow you down. I just need time to observe and document. That's all I ask."
    },
